                            rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1938, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, p. 868</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d715-f3" n="25" xml:id="d715-f3-content">
                <p>This paper bears the notation: “Capomazza says it was sent about the end of
                    February. W. S. M[urray]”.</p>
            </note>
